{"_id":"66e6cd431445942fb4684baf","id":"nazimali/kurdish-news-headlines","author":"nazimali","sha":"2863052dae026b07973991dde1dff2729b2e5c74","lastModified":"2024-09-15T12:08:14.000Z","private":false,"gated":false,"disabled":false,"tags":["task_categories:text-classification","task_categories:translation","language:ku","language:en","license:cc-by-4.0","size_categories:10K<n<100K","format:parquet","modality:text","library:datasets","library:dask","library:mlcroissant","library:polars","region:us","kurdish","translation","news"],"description":"\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tDataset Card for Kurdish News Dataset Headlines (KNDH)\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSummary\n\t\n\nDescription from the paper: the Kurdish language belongs to the Indo-Iranian family of Indo-European languages. It is well-known to be a close relative to the Persian language. The speakers span the intersections of Iran, Turkey, Iraq, and Syria. The Kurdish language is one of the official languages in Iraq and has regional status in Iran. The language has 40 million speakers [2,11].\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tUsage… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/nazimali/kurdish-news-headlines.","downloads":101,"likes":0,"cardData":{"language":["ku","en"],"license":"cc-by-4.0","size_categories":["10K<n<100K"],"task_categories":["text-classification","translation"],"pretty_name":"Kurdish News Dataset Headlines (KNDH)","dataset_info":{"features":[{"name":"label","dtype":"string"},{"name":"text","dtype":"string"},{"name":"text-english","dtype":"string"},{"name":"url","dtype":"string"}],"splits":[{"name":"train","num_bytes":17100983,"num_examples":50000}],"download_size":7349775,"dataset_size":17100983},"configs":[{"config_name":"default","data_files":[{"split":"train","path":"data/train-*"}]}],"tags":["kurdish","translation","news"]},"siblings":[{"rfilename":".gitattributes"},{"rfilename":"README.md"},{"rfilename":"data/train-00000-of-00018.parquet"},{"rfilename":"data/train-000